*****************************************************************************
                How To Register Your Copy Of ADF Disk Manager
*****************************************************************************

ADF-DM Registartion
-------------------

ADF-DM is shareware, so basically if you like it then please pay a little for
it. ADF-DM comes with a free 31 day trial, and also with every patch a futher
2 day trial of the new patch.. 

Will It Cost Me Anything?
-------------------------

Yes.. But very little by today's standards. In pounds sterling it is only œ10,
which is about the same as litre of vodka! For foreign payments a little
extra is require (about œ13, instead of œ10)..

What if I don`t register?
-------------------------

After the 31 days, DAF-DM will lock up and you will only have access to the
logo window and the `Unlock ADF-DM button`. The 31 days is there to allow
you to have a look at the program (14 days) and post payment to myself
(allowing 14 days for places like America -> UK).

What do I get if I register?
----------------------------

Free access to Web-Page (Not available to standard users), Free limited
technical support, and free upgrades to all future version. Patches don`t
have a 2 day trial on them!

How do I get registered?
------------------------

To register this package require 4 peices of information. Firstly your name,
your e-mail address (or your home address), telephone number and your
current version of ADF-DM..

What do I get in return?
------------------------

An activation string. Its basically 10 sets of 4 numbers. These will activate
ADF-DM for unlimited use and you don`t have to be re-keyed when you install
a patch or upgrade of ADF-DM!

What about the future?
----------------------

ADF-DM will continue to gather speed and features. Once you`ve paid the
registeration fee would will not need to pay again, thats even if the
amount goes up (which it may do!)...

How much is it ADF-DM?
----------------------

ADF-DM is œ10 sterling to UK and Southern Ireland users (Punts NOT accepted!)
and can be paid in a two ways, cheque or postal order..

U.K. Cheques - Simply make payable to `James Hunter` and cross it.
Postal Orders- Same as UK cheques..

Euro Cheques - Make cheques to the value of œ13 (For exchange rates)
               and payable to `James Hunter` (Cross them `Account Paye Only`)

Sterling Notes - You can send me direct sterling notes in a letter. Please
                 DO NOT send lose coins as post men will nick them. A œ10
                 sterling note is required.
Local currency - If you cannot get your currency changed then please sent
                 the equivilent of œ13 sterling. (NO COINS)

** FOR AN UP-TO-DATE LIST, PLEASE VISIT THE ADF-SUITE HOMEPAGE ON THE WEB **
      ** GOTO ADF-DM's, ABOUT Window and Select `Contact Information` **

