Things To Remember
------------------

* Don`t forget a e-mail address or snail-mail address.
* Don`t forget the registeration fee
* If you supply less money than required...
  Cheques/EuroCheques/PostalOrders - will be destroyed
  Money/Local Currency - Will be returned (cost of postage removed for currency)

